#! ia 1.0

@system product-base-system
  provider "local"
  version "0.1.0"
  describes "The public base product requirements system (inventarch/ia-product-base-kit). It mints the prd word, one Product Requirement Document record declaring problem statement, goals, non-goals, requirement clauses, lifecycle status and optional source locator and body digest, with consented relationships to @spec, @decision, @plan, @milestone, @task, @docket and @approval. It carries authoring guidance, ratification and decomposition rules, and the offline check-prds verifier. Proprietary PRD-to-spec procedures and external wiki connectors stay outside the public base; it grants no host authority."
  steward @agent product-base-system-steward
  requires
    - agent-system
    - compliance-system
    - governance-system
    - work-system
    - workspace-system
  discriminators
    prd lowers to definition
      category state
      facets [prd]
      schema @schema prd
      artifact-set product-definition
      primitive Attention
      move Observation
  edges
    cite * using prd
    cite prd using *
    ground spec, plan, milestone, task using prd
    require decision, milestone, task using prd
    supersede prd using prd
    govern prd using law, convention

@agent product-base-system-steward
  meaning
    says "Accountable owner of product-base-system vocabulary, canonical schema, authoring guidance, relationship consent, PRD ratification/traceability rules and offline PRD check."
    answers "Who owns the prd word?"
  governance
    applies [prd, convention, law, contract, check, case, agent, mandate, distribution]

@mandate product-base-system-stewardship
  meaning
    says "The bounded authority of product-base-system-steward over the product-base-system folder."
    answers "Which moves may product-base-system-steward make over the product-base-system folder?"
  governance
    requires "Claim no host permission or execution from this mandate; keep the public product base structural and free of proprietary decomposition rubrics, external credentials and tenant corpora."
  authority
    participant @agent product-base-system-steward
    moves [Observation, Verification, Synthesis]
    covers [".ia/src/systems/product-base-system/"]
